% F06-CODE: DEFECT 6, THE CODE WINDOW (FROM TESTS/IMAGE/B3-CODE).  W^
% CALLS REACH R8-8000 TO R8+7FFF, AND THE PAGE AFTER IS NOT CODE.  W2
% FITS BELOW R8+8000; W1'S CODE DOES NOT.
HEX
0 R8@+ 8000 + 10 - CODE_PNTR !
'W2 : 77 ;
"W2 " MSG W2 = CR
'W1 : 1 2 + 3 4 + 5 6 + 7 8 + + + + ;
"W1" MSG CR
"AFTER" MSG CR
